The default for Nethack is to have "games" as the owner for save files,
and the group is the default group of the user. And the permissions are 
-rw-rw---- . The directory doesn't have write permissions for group, so
the group write permission for single files there shouldn't matter.
The game itself is -rwsr-xr-x and user.group is games.bin.
(I know some people prefer running the game sgid instead of suid, but suid
is the default configuration.)

